From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: sc8280xp: Enable the CSID IPP and VFE pixel pipeline

Mark the four full CSIDs as having an IPP, and give the four full VFEs
the Bayer input and NV12/NV21 output formats of their pixel pipeline.
The VFE lites keep their RDI only PIX line.

Before this change the PIX line of the full VFEs used the RDI format
table, and the CSID programmed RDI registers for port 3, which a full
CSID does not have.

Co-developed-by: dezige131 <2643591270@qq.com>
Signed-off-by: dezige131 <2643591270@qq.com>
Signed-off-by: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c | 16 ++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

